{"4474140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Geometry Missile", "steam_appid": 4474140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geometry Missile</strong> is a side-scrolling obstacle-avoidance flyer game where you try to reach the end while avoiding collisions to the edges that will end your run. Score as high as possible. Completing consecutive levels will not reset your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, hard to master. Accuracy and precision is a must.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/997fcb2616961725979b40156a2d8979.poster.avif?t=1773635388\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/997fcb2616961725979b40156a2d8979.webm?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/997fcb2616961725979b40156a2d8979.mp4?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid collisions to sharp edges as much as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/918a7421e560df1c1fe47c74156cec55.poster.avif?t=1773635388\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/918a7421e560df1c1fe47c74156cec55.webm?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/918a7421e560df1c1fe47c74156cec55.mp4?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flat surfaces can be helpful. Use them wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/ec54c65f62b6eb61548256c5772aed01.poster.avif?t=1773635388\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/ec54c65f62b6eb61548256c5772aed01.webm?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/ec54c65f62b6eb61548256c5772aed01.mp4?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the end to complete the level and unlock the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/cd9c90421a4b23b4ce8a00cbb4d94185.poster.avif?t=1773635388\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/cd9c90421a4b23b4ce8a00cbb4d94185.webm?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/cd9c90421a4b23b4ce8a00cbb4d94185.mp4?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete up to 64 carefully designed levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/39a9ef223bcfdab482dcfd248dcb40af.poster.avif?t=1773635388\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/39a9ef223bcfdab482dcfd248dcb40af.webm?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/39a9ef223bcfdab482dcfd248dcb40af.mp4?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geometry Missile</strong> is a side-scrolling obstacle-avoidance flyer game where you try to reach the end while avoiding collisions to the edges that will end your run. Score as high as possible. Completing consecutive levels will not reset your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, hard to master. Accuracy and precision is a must.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/997fcb2616961725979b40156a2d8979.poster.avif?t=1773635388\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/997fcb2616961725979b40156a2d8979.webm?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/997fcb2616961725979b40156a2d8979.mp4?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid collisions to sharp edges as much as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/918a7421e560df1c1fe47c74156cec55.poster.avif?t=1773635388\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474140/extras/918a7421e560df1c1fe47c74156cec55.webm?t=1773635388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst